/*
  TirePressureSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0151 · TirePressureSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TirePressureSection` resolves (table "TirePressureSection") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drive-detail/TirePressureSection.tsx). The remainder
  back the native state envelope (short wheel names, the no-value placeholder, freshness
  chip, connectivity banner, loading / empty / error chrome) and the chart axes.
*/

